Package: camtrapDensity
Type: Package
Title: Density Estimation Functions for camtrapDP Data
Version: 0.1.17
Authors@R: person(given = "Marcus", family = "Rowcliffe", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "marcus.rowcliffe@ioz.ac.uk")
Author: Marcus Rowcliffe
Maintainer: Marcus Rowcliffe <marcus.rowcliffe@ioz.ac.uk>
Description: Currently provides functions for working with camtrapDP format data
    exported from Agouti - checking deployment calibration diagnostic plots,
    filtering deployments, correcting mis-specified date-time data at specific 
    deployments, running REM density analysis.
